{"ref":"BDB, חֲגוֹרָה","hw":"חֲגוֹרָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲגוֹרָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. girdle loin-covering, belt</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">חֲגוֹרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.24\">Is 3:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲגֹרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.11\">2 S 18:11</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.21\">2 K 3:21</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲגֹרָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.5\">1 K 2:5</a>; Pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲגֹרֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:7\" href=\"/Genesis.3.7\">Gn 3:7</a>;—<em>girdle, loin-covering</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:7\" href=\"/Genesis.3.7\">Gn 3:7</a> (J); as article of women’s dress <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.24\">Is 3:24</a>; <em>belt</em> of warrior <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.5\">1 K 2:5</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.21\">2 K 3:21</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(חֹגֵר ח׳)</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.11\">2 S 18:11</a>.—On <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲג֖וֹרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.11\">Is 32:11</a> v. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָגַר</span> <strong>1</strong>.","next":"BDB, מַחֲגֹ֫רֶת","prev":"BDB, חָגוֹר"}